# mac2ibm  5. october 1988 [gh]##--------------------------------------------------------------------------# This file folds the 13 scandinavian nonstandard characters in the Mac-# intosh 8 bit character set into the same in the IBM-PC character set.#### NB: The two sets have many more characters in common than the 13 listed##     in this file. To add those are left as an exercise for the reader.####     Some people has reported that they have got the error message "bad##     conversion table" when using this file.  This may be due to junk at##     the end.  The problem may be fixed by running this file through pep##     with the command: "pep -o mac2ibm" .##--------------------------------------------------------------------------174 146               ## AE ==> [175 157               ## OE ==> \129 143               ## AA ==> ]190 145               ## ae ==> {191 155               ## oe ==> |140 134               ## aa ==> }142 130               ## e'143 138               ## e`131 144               ## E'138 132               ## ae (svensk)128 142               ## AE (svensk)154 148               ## oe (svensk)133 153               ## OE (svensk)## EOF